**********************************************************************
Supplementary Datasets
**********************************************************************

These tables are used to validate certain fields on the data entry
form.  There are seven validation tables:
    Action areas
    Awarding authorities
    Award codes
    Rank/rate codes
    Campaign periods
    Corps
    Enlisted ratings


Validation Table Datasets

  The validation table datasets contain tables used by the FMS UARs
  to validate user input on certain fields.  These tables have been
  loaded with data values that were agreed upon by BDM, OP-09B33 and
  CMC/MHM users.  These tables are maintained by the VALID command.
  Entries in these tables can be added or deleted and the tables can
  be printed out.  The datasets are described below.

The validation table datasets are stored in the following datasets:
   ACTION_AREAS_TAB
   AWARD_AUTH_TAB
   AWARD_CODE_TAB
   CAMPAIGN_TAB
   CORPS_TAB
   GRADE_CODE_TAB
   RATINGS_TAB

