Ratings_tab
This table is used to validate the GRADE/RATING field for all Navy enlisted.
It contains the following fields:
==================================================================================================

Num  Field                Field     Column      Fld  Field                            
ber  Name                 Type      Position    Len  Description                        
---  ------------------   -------   ---------   ---  --------------------                    
  1  SHORT_FORM           Text         1    6     6  Four letter RATINGS 
                                                     code.    

  2  LONG_FORM            Text         7   65    59  Full description of
                                                     RATINGS. 

  3  CODE                 Text        66   67     2  Two letter 
                                                     PAY_GRADE.

  4  ENTRY_DATE           Date_       68   83    16  Date record was
                          Time                       entered.

  5  CHANGE_DATE          Date_       84   99    16  Date record was
                          Time                       modified.











